### All runs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/runs

### One run
GET http://localhost:8080/api/runs/1

### Missing run (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/runs/99

### Runs by location
GET http://localhost:8080/api/runs/location/OUTDOOR

### Create a run (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 10,
  "title": "Sunday Hill Repeats",
  "startedOn": "2026-09-27T08:00:00",
  "completedOn": "2026-09-27T08:40:00",
  "miles": 4,
  "location": "OUTDOOR"
}

### Invalid run - blank title (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 11,
  "title": "",
  "startedOn": "2026-09-27T08:00:00",
  "completedOn": "2026-09-27T08:40:00",
  "miles": 4,
  "location": "OUTDOOR"
}

### Update a run (expect 204)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/runs/10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 10,
  "title": "Sunday Hill Repeats (hard)",
  "startedOn": "2026-09-27T08:00:00",
  "completedOn": "2026-09-27T08:50:00",
  "miles": 5,
  "location": "OUTDOOR"
}

### Delete a run (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/runs/10

### Users from the external API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### One user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
